!
! This test calculates the CCSD(T) energy of
! employing valence-only Hamitonian
! for relativistic effective-core-potentials.
! Note the keyword .ECP in **GENERAL.
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
HI molecule with RECP
.WAVE F
**GENERAL
.ECP
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
.RELCCSD
*DHFCAL
.CLOSED SHELL
8
*END OF DIRAC

 &RELCCSD TIMING=T, DOENER=T &END
 &CCENER DOMP2=T, DOCCSD=T, DOCCSDT=T &END


    *************************************************************************
    ************************* HI molecule with RECP *************************
    *************************************************************************

 Jobs in this run:
   * Wave function
   * If crash, end with the segment.fault. Worth for debugging.


